"""Sinh boi AlphaAI (Groq, generate_and_verify - qua ai_connect) SAU KHI
sua prompt reference trong alphaai_codegen.py (ternary phai la kieu C
"cond ? a : b", KHONG phai kieu Python "a if cond else b" - ban dau AI
dung dung cu phap Python, bien dich "thanh cong" nhung SAI KET QUA vi
parse_expr() truoc day IM LANG bo qua phan con lai sau bieu thuc dau
tien; da sua parse_expr them kiem tra EOF, xem il_codegen.py).
Ham nay la ban Python TUONG DUONG (viet tay) de doi chieu CPython that,
vi cu phap ternary kieu C khong phai Python hop le."""


def clamp_i32(x: "i32", lo: "i32", hi: "i32") -> "i32":
    if x < lo:
        return lo
    if x > hi:
        return hi
    return x
